HOYPLOMA DEPARTMENT OF UNUSUAL PHENOMENA
GETTING A WORKOUT IN THE MIDDLE OF NOWHERE

Have you ever woken up in the middle of nowhere, far from civilization? Unable to move a limb like a normal person?
That's completely normal.
